thm\" switch. \"Free\" is the game as before. \"On the beat\" means that in combat your step goes only on the beat, one cell per beat, together with the enemies. A click right after the beat steps at once; an early click waits for the beat and is shown as a green hologram on the des","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:21:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035423","verified_at":"2026-10-23T10:33:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5095060-1846651706691482","game_id":"steam-5095060","kind":"announcement","title":"AsterMaster is in Steam Next Fest — free demo, updated build","summary":"Steam Next Fest is live and the AsterMaster demo is in it — free, no key, 15–20 minute runs.What changed since the demo launched (thanks to everyone who sent feedback):• Callouts (TRIPLE KILL, RAMPAGE…) now use a dedicated display font and are larger; mod and power-up icons got backing plates so they read at 1080p.• Dash: double-click dash can now be turned off in Settings (mouse players kept triggering it by accident), and right-clicking a cell dashes there regardless of the setting.• Mines now","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:01:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691482","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5095060-1846018067926098","game_id":"steam-5095060","kind":"announcement","title":"AsterMaster free demo is out now on Steam","summary":"The AsterMaster demo is free — hit “Download Demo” on the store page.It isn’t “five minutes and credits”. It’s the asteroid’s first segment looped downward: clear the arena, a descent platform opens, and the next horizon hits harder than the last.What’s inside:— the full combat loop: weapon mods, synergies, power-ups, depths, smugglers and a bounty on your head — same as the full game;— a three-way fork before the first arena, a different mod in each passage: pick one and you walk into the boss ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T13:18:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926098","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5095060":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:53:30Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T22:53:30Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5095060":"2026-10-25T22:53:30Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5095060":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:53:30Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:53:30Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5178780":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:53:30Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:53:30Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}}}
